  "dek": "Chen’s latest recorded improvement opens a 10.97-point lead over Tufa Labs. Son & Mark & Ronen move to sixth, while Peter Findley’s human mastery earns a commissioned front-page examination.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Early edition · October 12\n\nARC-AGI-3: Yi-Chia Chen’s latest recorded improvement raises the leading mark to 67.49, ahead of Tufa Labs at 56.52. Son & Mark & Ronen gain 2.45 against the morning baseline and move to sixth. AFF AI CLUB remains tenth after its earlier climb into the provisional gold places.\n\nMark Barney’s commissioned Peter Findley feature runs above the recap: shared human action minima across all 25 public games, and analysis of how that judgment might transfer to an agent. No submission method is established.\n\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-12-morning-arc-3",
