        "wire-2026-10-11-2158-arc-3-jingshui-fu-breaks-into-top-100",
        "wire-2026-10-12-0556-arc-3-spacedebri-enters-top-hundred"
      ],
      "text": "The wire also followed a wider chase. Its evening filing placed Hugo Thorvaldsen in the top 25 at 35.49, and a later overnight filing had the entry 26th at the same score. Jingshui Fu’s recorded jump from 0.10 to 33.22 supplied another substantial move. SpaceDebri’s morning wire revisited an earlier climb into the top hundred at 32.93; that longer-window gain should not be counted again as fresh overnight progress. In this edition’s selected comparisons, Tong Hui Kang gained 1.28 to 32.48 and rose 119 places to 106th, while Zakinosuke added 1.01 to reach 32.31 and 114th. The close records observed results, not assurance that every submitted run has finished evaluating."
    }
